1 0 0 1 50 679.89 Tm (#### Movement Rules & Step Costs) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 665.89 Tm (The robot can execute at most one step at a time from its current cell across six) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 651.89 Tm (permitted directions:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 637.89 Tm (* **Right:** $\(+1, 0\)$ with cost $+2$) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 623.89 Tm (* **Left:** $\(-1, 0\)$ with cost $-1$) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 609.89 Tm (* **Up:** $\(0, +1\)$ with cost $+2$) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 595.89 Tm (* **Down:** $\(0, -1\)$ with cost $-1$) Tj
