1 0 0 1 50 553.89 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 539.89 Tm (*Note:* Downward diagonal movements \(Down-Right and Down-Left\) are strictly) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 525.89 Tm (disallowed.) Tj
