1 0 0 1 50 105.88999999999999 Tm (   * If edge weights are positive and uniform, fewest hops equals lowest cost.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 91.88999999999999 Tm (   * In this environment, costs are **heterogeneous and asymmetric** \(ranging from) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 77.88999999999999 Tm ($-3$ for Up-Left to $+3$ for Up-Right, plus $+5$ destruction and penalty fees\).) Tj
