1 0 0 1 50 679.89 Tm (   * DFS commits to the first path leading to the goal along its search branch.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 665.89 Tm (   * As demonstrated in our experiments, changing successor ordering alters path cost) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 651.89 Tm (from $34$ to $75$ on the identical grid. DFS provides zero optimality guarantees.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 637.89 Tm () Tj
