1 0 0 1 50 721.89 Tm (* **The Interplay of Energy and Graph Traversal:** In standard grid pathfinding,) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 707.89 Tm (visiting the same $\(x, y\)$ coordinate multiple times indicates a cycle. However, in) Tj
